# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NexusProd — Production Order Management App
#
# This project is a polyglot repo:
#   * .NET 8 API            (src/NexusProd.Api)        -> bin/, obj/, wwwroot/
#   * React + Vite client   (client/)                  -> client/dist/
#   * Node legacy bridge    (server/, scripts/)        -> node_modules/
#   * Vite build artifact   (client/dist -> wwwroot)   -> src/NexusProd.Api/wwwroot/
#
# Keep this file the single source of truth for "do not commit" patterns.
# Sections below are grouped by ecosystem. Order: most-specific → most-general.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ============================================================
# Secrets — NEVER commit
# ============================================================
# db_config.json holds plaintext MySQL credentials. Tracked historically
# with default credentials; if you must re-include it, rotate the password
# first and document the rotation in DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md.
server/db_config.json

# Generic .env files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local-only overrides for tooling (eslint, prettier, vite, etc.)
*.local
**/*.local

# ============================================================
# .NET / Visual Studio — build artifacts
# ============================================================
# Standard MSBuild outputs
bin/
obj/
out/

# Compiled binaries and symbols
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache
*.cache.json
*.sourcelink.json
*.AssemblyInfo.cs
*AssemblyInfoInputs.cache
apphost.exe
rjsmcshtml.dswa.cache.json
rjsmrazor.dswa.cache.json
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.runtimeconfig.dev.json
*.json.local
*.user
*.suo

# VS workspace + Rider / VS Code (project-wide)
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Rider
*.sln.docstates
*.swp

# Resharper
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper

# ============================================================
# Node / npm / pkg — dependency trees and packager output
# ============================================================
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# pkg (the packager that turns the server into nexus-prod.exe) drops its
# single-file output at the repo root
dist/
*.exe.local

# ============================================================
# Vite / React client — build output
# ============================================================
# The client build outputs to client/dist by default, AND vite.config.js
# is configured to also write into src/NexusProd.Api/wwwroot so the
# .NET server can serve the SPA from a single executable. Both must
# stay ignored — they're regenerated on every `npm run build`.
client/dist/
**/dist/

# Vite/React build sidecar files
*.tsbuildinfo
*.local
.vite/

# ============================================================
# Vite output that gets copied into the .NET wwwroot
# ============================================================
# vite.config.js: `build.outDir = '../src/NexusProd.Api/wwwroot'`
# These are generated; ignore the whole folder. If you ever need to
# ship a static asset from the API project, add it under src/NexusProd.
# Api/Resources/ instead.
src/NexusProd.Api/wwwroot/
!**/wwwroot/.gitkeep

# ============================================================
# Logs
# ============================================================
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
dotnet-build.log
build.log

# ============================================================
# Test / coverage output
# ============================================================
coverage/
*.lcov
.nyc_output/

# ============================================================
# OS / editor scratch
# ============================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Vim / Emacs
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.un~
\#*\#
.\#*

# ============================================================
# Misc / scratch
# ============================================================
*.pid
*.pid.lock
*.seed
*.tgz
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache

# Backup files
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej